{"key":"subset-sum-38efa35a6b84d1a8","sourceHash":"38efa35a6b84d1a86f6ad67ad484cfda6e95a5828da47010bde472ea30a6bdf4","pattern":"subset-sum","category":"dynamic-2d","title":"Challenge: Subset Sum DP","idea":"Track reachable totals and update backward so every item is used at most once.","complexity":"O(n*target) time · O(target) space","source":"fn subset_sum(values: &[usize], target: usize) -> bool {\n    let mut reachable = vec![false; target + 1];\n    reachable[0] = true;\n    for &x in values {\n        for sum in (x..=target).rev() {\n            reachable[sum] |= reachable[sum - x];\n        }\n    }\n    reachable[target]\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = subset_sum(&[5, 5], 11).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"let mut reachable = vec![false; target + 1];"},{"line":3,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"reachable[0] = true;"},{"line":4,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"for &x in values {"},{"line":5,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"for sum in (x..=target).rev() {"},{"line":6,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"reachable[sum] |= reachable[sum - x];"},{"line":7,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"}"},{"line":9,"function":"subset_sum","statement":"reachable[target]"},{"line":13,"function":"main","statement":"let result = subset_sum(&[5, 5], 11).to_string();"},{"line":14,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":15,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[5,5]","stdout":"false\n","values":[{"type":"&[usize]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"11"}},{"type":"alloc::vec::Vec<bool>","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"false"},{"kind":"scalar","text